# Titania's "Ward--Discard a card or pay {2}", paid by discarding (CR 702.21a, 118.12): Bot1 casts Titania on turn 1 with
# three Moxen and an Island discarded. On turn 2 Bot2 taps its only mana for a Lightning Bolt, so it cannot pay {2} and is
# asked only about the discard; it accepts and discards an Island, so the Bolt is not countered and deals 3 to the 5/5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Titania, Rugged Rumbler
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Titania, Rugged Rumbler.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Discard a card)
Bot1.Choose(Island)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Titania, Rugged Rumbler)
Bot2.Accept
Bot2.Choose(Island)

[Expect]
Turn = 2
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Titania, Rugged Rumbler.Damage = 3
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Island
